# SQLite, including its write-ahead log and shared-memory sidecars. `*.db`
# alone is not enough: a `-wal` holds pages not yet checkpointed into the
# database, so it carries exactly the same taxpayer data -- and both were
# staged for commit while real.db itself was correctly ignored.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
